\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Phase 2 sensitivity heat-map: per-cell range of $f_{\rm  CW}$ across the four environment classes \{void, wall, filament, cluster\} in percentage points. Each cell corresponds to a complete V-Web re-run on the $14{,}622{,}283$-galaxy DESI DR1 spectro sample at $(R_s, \lambda _{\rm  th})$. The maximum range across all nine cells is $0.22$\,percentage points (at $R_s\!=\!25\,{\rm  Mpc}/h, \lambda _{\rm  th}\!=\!0.3$). The headline environmental-independence result is robust to V-Web hyperparameter choices over the range probed.}}{9}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:phase2}{{5}{9}{Phase 2 sensitivity heat-map: per-cell range of $f_{\rm CW}$ across the four environment classes \{void, wall, filament, cluster\} in percentage points. Each cell corresponds to a complete V-Web re-run on the $14{,}622{,}283$-galaxy DESI DR1 spectro sample at $(R_s, \lambda _{\rm th})$. The maximum range across all nine cells is $0.22$\,percentage points (at $R_s\!=\!25\,{\rm Mpc}/h, \lambda _{\rm th}\!=\!0.3$). The headline environmental-independence result is robust to V-Web hyperparameter choices over the range probed}{figure.5}{}}
